Third-party content

The over-engineering-audit skill adapts its review lens and tag taxonomy from
ponytail (https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail), MIT licensed. Prompt
content was adapted; no machinery was copied.

Community skills listed in skills.txt are fetched from their upstream
repositories at install time and are not redistributed here. Each retains its
own licence. See skills.txt for the source of each.

SDD slash commands are generated at setup time by slash-man from
liatrio-labs/spec-driven-workflow and are not committed to this repository.
